# WiziBox Android 9 port configuration; modified 2026-10-11.
# Bring-up mitigation, not a completed Intel HWC fence fix.
# The matching SurfaceFlinger candidate reads this in its constructor.
# Set before class core starts: switching only after registration is too late.
on post-fs-data
    setprop debug.acer.client_from_start 1
